WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.400
At the top of Billing is your balance: what's due now, across all your children.

2
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:16.260
Your centre sends an invoice for each billing period. Each one lists your child's care, any extras, and any credits or subsidies.

3
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:25.430
If your centre takes part in CWELCC, Canada's reduced-fee program, the reduction is already taken off before you pay.

4
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.430
You can pay any invoice right here, by card, e-Transfer or direct debit.

5
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:41.290
Each year, your annual childcare receipt for taxes is available from your centre. If anything looks wrong on a bill, message your director.
